{"articleID": 4767, "articleRevisionID": 442993, "knowledgeCategoryID": 1229, "breadcrumbs": [{"name": "Administrator Documentation", "url": "https://community.d2l.com/brightspace/kb/administrator-documentation"}], "knowledgeBaseID": 134, "name": "Assignments data sets", "body": "<p>Brightspace Data Sets for Assignments have a dependency on <span>Assignments</span>. If you turn this tool on and off during the data set query period, there may be unexpected or missing content in your data sets.</p>\n<h2 data-id=\"entity-relationship-diagram\">Entity Relationship Diagram</h2>\n<p>The following diagram shows the relationships between entities used to create Brightspace Data Sets for Assignments. To enlarge the diagram, right-click on the image and select <b>Open image in a new tab</b>.</p>\n<p><br/><img src=\"https://us.v-cdn.net/6036482/uploads/RN7Q8EIB0HDW/datasets-erds-extracted-from-schemas-assignments.png\" title=\"Entity Relationship Diagram for the Assignment tables\" alt=\"Entity Relationship Diagram for the Assignment tables\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=300,width=300/6036482/uploads/RN7Q8EIB0HDW/datasets-erds-extracted-from-schemas-assignments.png 300w, https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=600,width=600/6036482/uploads/RN7Q8EIB0HDW/datasets-erds-extracted-from-schemas-assignments.png 600w, https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=800,width=800/6036482/uploads/RN7Q8EIB0HDW/datasets-erds-extracted-from-schemas-assignments.png 800w, https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=1200,width=1200/6036482/uploads/RN7Q8EIB0HDW/datasets-erds-extracted-from-schemas-assignments.png 1200w, https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=1600,width=1600/6036482/uploads/RN7Q8EIB0HDW/datasets-erds-extracted-from-schemas-assignments.png 1600w, https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=2000,width=2000/6036482/uploads/RN7Q8EIB0HDW/datasets-erds-extracted-from-schemas-assignments.png 2000w, https://us.v-cdn.net/6036482/uploads/RN7Q8EIB0HDW/datasets-erds-extracted-from-schemas-assignments.png\" sizes=\"100vw\" class=\"embedImage-img importedEmbed-img\"></img><br/></p>\n<p><a name=\"About_Availability_Type\" id=\"About_Availability_Type\">About Availability Type</a></p>\n<p>Availability type determines whether learners can view or access assignments. Possible column values and their meanings are:</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"1\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\"><col></col><col></col><thead><tr><th>Value</th>\n<th>Availability type</th>\n                </tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td>\n<td>\n<p><i>AccessRestricted</i><br/></p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr><td>1</td>\n<td>\n<p><i>SubmissionRestricted</i><br/></p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr><td>2</td>\n<td>\n<p><i>Hidden</i><br/></p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr></tbody></table><p>\u00a0</p>\n<h2 data-id=\"assignment-special-access\">Assignment Special Access</h2>\n<p>The <b>Assignment Special Access</b> Brightspace Data Set returns all applicable special access start, end, and due dates for each assignment in the organization.</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"1\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\"><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><thead><tr><th><span>Version <br/>History</span><br/></th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Field</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Description</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Type</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Size</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Key</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n                </tr></thead><tbody><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>5.8/6.1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">DropboxId</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">Unique assignment identifier</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">bigint</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">8</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">PK,FK</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>5.8/6.1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">UserId</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>Unique user identifier.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">int</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">4</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">PK,FK</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>5.8/6.1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">StartDate</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>Assignment special access availability start date  (UTC).</p>\n<p>Field can be null.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">datetime2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">8</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\u00a0</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>5.8/6.1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">EndDate</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>Assignment special access availability end date (UTC).</p>\n<p>Field can be null.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">datetime2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">8</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\u00a0</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>5.8/6.1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">DueDate</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>Assignment special access due date\u00a0(UTC).</p>\n<p>Field can be null.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">datetime2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">8</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\u00a0</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>5.8/6.1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">ModifiedBy</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">User who modified the assignment special access.</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">int</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">4</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">FK</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>5.8/6.1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">LastModified</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">Date when the special access was last modified for the assignment (UTC)</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">datetime2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">8</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\u00a0</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>5.8/6.1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">IsDeleted</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">Indicates if special access has been deleted.</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">bit</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\u00a0</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>7.13</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">StartDateAvailabilityType </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>Determines whether learners can view or access the assignment before the StartDate. See <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"#About_Availability_Type\">About Availability Type</a> for details.</p>\n<p>No data available for  assignments  created before December 2022/20.22.12.</p>\n<p>Field can be null.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">smallint</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\u00a0</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>7.13</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">EndDateAvailabilityType </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>Determines whether learners can view or access the assignment after the EndDate.  See <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"#About_Availability_Type\">About Availability Type</a> for details.</p>\n<p>No data available for  assignments created before December 2022/20.22.12.</p>\n<p>Field can be null.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">smallint</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\u00a0</td>\n                </tr></tbody></table><p>\u00a0</p>\n<h2 data-id=\"assignment-submission-details\">Assignment Submission Details</h2>\n<p>The <b>Assignment Submission Details</b> Brightspace Data Set returns details of each individual submission made by the user for all your org units. Results are ordered from newest to oldest.</p>\n<p>Soft deleted records have TRUE in the <b>IsDeleted</b> column. If a record is indirectly deleted when its parent entity (org unit or dropbox) is deleted, the IsDeleted value does not change to TRUE.</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"1\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\"><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><thead><tr><th><span>Version <br/>History</span><br/></th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Field</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Description</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Type</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Size</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>Can be null?</th>\n<th><b>Key</b><br/></th>\n                </tr></thead><tbody><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>2.5 / 3.0 - Removed FK</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>SubmissionId</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Unique submission identifier</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bigint</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>8</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>\n<p>PK</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>1.0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>DropboxId</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Unique assignment identifier</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bigint</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>8</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>\n<p>FK</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>\n<p>10.6 - Added FK</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>UserId</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Unique user identifier.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bigint</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>8</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>\n<p>FK</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>\n<p>5.7 / 6.0 - Changed Type and Column Size</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>GroupId</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Unique group identifier for the submission made to the assignment.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bigint</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>8</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>5.7 / 6.0 - Changed Type and Column Size</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>NumberOfFilesSubmitted</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Number of files submitted.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>int</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>4</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>10.6 - Updated Description</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>TotalFileSize</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Total file size of all submissions made, in bytes.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bigint</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>8</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>1.0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>SubmittedByUserId</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Submission made by user ID</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>int</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>4</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>\n<p>FK</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>\n<p>1.0</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>DateSubmitted</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Date the submission was made (UTC).</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>datetime2</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>8</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>1.0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>Comments</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Comments on the submission.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>nvarchar</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>1000</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>\n<p>1.0</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>IsTurnItInExempt</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Is exempt from TurnItIn.</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bit</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>1</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>1.0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>IsDeleted</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Is submission deleted</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bit</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>1</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>1.0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>IsPreview</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>Is submission preview</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bit</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>1</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>10.6</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">Version</td>\n<td>Supports version tracking for assignment submission records that change over time.</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">bigint</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">8</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>\u00a0</td>\n                </tr></tbody></table><p>\u00a0</p>\n<h2 data-id=\"assignment-submissions\">Assignment Submissions</h2>\n<p>The <b>Assignment Submissions</b> Brightspace Data Set returns a high-level summary information of all submissions made by a user to a given assignment for all your org units. Results are ordered from newest to oldest.</p>\n<table><col></col><col></col><tbody><tr><td><br/><img src=\"https://us.v-cdn.net/6036482/uploads/0NXL0WPJI8VZ/print-notes.png\" alt=\"This is the paper note and pencil icon used for notes.\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=300,width=300/6036482/uploads/0NXL0WPJI8VZ/print-notes.png 300w, https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=600,width=600/6036482/uploads/0NXL0WPJI8VZ/print-notes.png 600w, https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=800,width=800/6036482/uploads/0NXL0WPJI8VZ/print-notes.png 800w, https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=1200,width=1200/6036482/uploads/0NXL0WPJI8VZ/print-notes.png 1200w, https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=1600,width=1600/6036482/uploads/0NXL0WPJI8VZ/print-notes.png 1600w, https://us.v-cdn.net/cdn-cgi/image/quality=80,format=auto,fit=scale-down,height=2000,width=2000/6036482/uploads/0NXL0WPJI8VZ/print-notes.png 2000w, https://us.v-cdn.net/6036482/uploads/0NXL0WPJI8VZ/print-notes.png\" sizes=\"100vw\" class=\"embedImage-img importedEmbed-img\"></img><br/></td>\n<td><b>Note</b>: The Feedback column is now 1000 characters and is no longer controlled by the <b>d2l.Tools.BrightspaceDataSets.TruncateLimit</b> configuration variable setting. To retrieve feedback beyond this limit, refer to our <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://docs.valence.desire2learn.com/res/dropbox.html#get--d2l-api-le-(version)-(orgUnitId)-dropbox-folders-(folderId)-feedback-(entityType)-(entityId)\">Brightspace Developer Platform API</a>.</td>\n                </tr></tbody></table><table cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"1\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px;\"><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><col></col><thead><tr><th><span>Version <br/>History</span><br/></th>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Field</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Type</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>\n<p><b>Size</b><br/></p>\n                    </th>\n<th>Can be null?</th>\n<th><b>Description</b><br/></th>\n                </tr></thead><tbody><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>2.5/3.0 - Added FK</td>\n<td>PK, FK</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>DropboxId</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bigint</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>8</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Unique assignment identifier.</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>1.0</td>\n<td>FK</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>OrgUnitId</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>int</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>4</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Unique org unit identifier.</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>5.0</td>\n<td>PK, FK</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">SubmitterId</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">bigint</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">The user or group ID of the submitter.</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>\n<p>10.7 - Added PK</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>PK</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">SubmitterType</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">varchar</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">The type of submission, either user or group.</td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>10.7 - Updated nullability</td>\n<td>\u00a0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>FileSubmissionCount</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>int</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>4</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Number of files submitted to the assignment.</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>10.7 - Updated nullability</td>\n<td>\u00a0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>TotalFileSize</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bigint</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>8</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Total file size of all submissions, in bytes.</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>\n<p>10.7 - Added FK</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>FK</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>FeedbackUserId</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>int</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>4</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Feedback by user ID.</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>1.0</td>\n<td>\u00a0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>FeedbackIsRead</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bit</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>1</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Is feedback read.</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>4.8 / 5.2 - Updated column size</td>\n<td>\u00a0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>Score</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>decimal</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>19, 9</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Score the user achieved on the assignment submission.</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>1.0</td>\n<td>\u00a0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>IsGraded</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>bit</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>1</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Is assignment submission graded.</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>1.0</td>\n<td>\u00a0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>LastSubmissionDate</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>datetime2</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>8</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Last submission date time (UTC).</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>1.0 - Updated description</td>\n<td>\u00a0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>Feedback</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>nvarchar</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>1000</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Instructor feedback.</p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr><tr align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><td>6.16 / 7.4 - Updated description</td>\n<td>\u00a0</td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>FeedbackLastModified</p>\n                    </td>\n<td style=\"width: 134px;\">\n<p>datetime2</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>\n<p>8</p>\n                    </td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td style=\"width: 95px;\">\n<p>Last modified